-- The soul gate (ruled 2026-07-11): spawn fuel is consumed in the barrier that mints the Ghost. Twin of 025-soul-gate.bqn. (was s10-soul-gate)
-- The statement consumes each selected Soul while spawning one Ghost. Spawned Ghosts receive Soul 0, so a second run over this unchanged world emits nothing.
--! registry ../registries/025-soul-gate.reg
--! expect-n 8
--! expect keys = 0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7
--! expect nord = 1 1 0 1 0 0 1 1
--! expect dead = 1 0 0 1 0 1 1 1
--! expect ghost = 0 0 0 0 0 0 1 1
--! expect soul = 0 1 0 0 0 0 0 0

Nord & Dead & Soul , Soul = 0 ; spawn Ghost
